SUMMARY:You Can See Everything (2026)
LOCATION:Laurelhurst Theater\, 2735 E Burnside St\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5231;-122.6375
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Nathan Fielder · 174 min\n\nThirty-four days before she's
  sent to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invite
 s a skeptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an inti
 mate portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year jour
 ney into the abyss.\n\nTickets: https://3677.formovietickets.com:2235/T.AS
 P?WCI=bt&Page=PickTickets&SHOWID=46381\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohk
 amp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
