BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:laurelhurst-20261107T121500-wild-horse-nine-2026@small-screens-pdx
DTSTAMP:20261104T202843Z
DTSTART:20261107T201500Z
DTEND:20261107T221200Z
SUMMARY:Wild Horse Nine (2026)
LOCATION:Laurelhurst Theater\, 2735 E Burnside St\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5231;-122.6375
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Martin McDonagh · 117 min\n\nShortly before the 1973 Chil
 ean coup\, CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter
  Island by their bureau chief\, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues\, 
 and as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present con
 spiracies\, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threa
 tens to send everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\n\nTicket
 s: https://3677.formovietickets.com:2235/T.ASP?WCI=bt&Page=PickTickets&SHO
 WID=46371\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-p
 dx/
